{"ticker":"DEEPAKFERT","symbol":"DEEPAKFERT","instrumentId":3022870,"name":"Deepak Fertilisers","industry":"NSE-Chemicals-Specialty","about":"Deepak Fertilisers and Petrochemicals Corporation Ltd. (DFPCL), has evolved into one of India’s foremost producers of fertilizers and industrial chemicals. Starting as an Ammonia manufacturer, DFPCL now boasts an extensive product portfolio, including industrial chemicals, bulk and specialty fertilizers, technical ammonium nitrate, and value-added real estate. With state-of-the-art manufacturing facilities across Maharashtra, Andhra Pradesh, Haryana, and Gujarat, the company is committed to producing high-quality products that meet global standards. DFPCL’s strategic focus on growth, innovation, and diversification has positioned it as a trusted leader in Indian and global markets, driving synergies across its business segments and creating value for its stakeholders.","website":"www.dfpcl.com","location":"Pune, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:15:30.983Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":1449.9,"changePct":-2.066869300911848,"week52High":1664.3,"week52Low":872.1},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹18,303 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹12,432 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"68,168,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"193"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"31,072,992"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.69%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.67"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"2.3"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"60.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.04"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.73"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"4%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"15.72"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"7–22"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"10.8%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"16.34"},{"label":"Volume","value":"264,486"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"400,501"},{"label":"Master score","value":"70"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"78"},{"label":